  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Oct 14, 2026 at 03:18 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                            <li>\n                                                        \n                                                            \n                                                                Read by \n                                                            \n                                                            100 Professionals\n                                                        \n                                                    </li>\n                                                                                    </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>New Delhi: <a href=\"/tag/pb+health\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PB Health</a>, backed by PB Fintech Limited, the holding company of <a href=\"/tag/policy+bazaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Policy Bazaar</a> has launched its first hospital in Gurugram.The 100-bed <a href=\"/tag/multispecialty+hospital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">multispecialty hospital</a> at Iffco Chowk, DLF Phase 2, Gurugram marks the first physical anchor of PB Health.According to PB Health, the hospital will offer services across Neuro Sciences, Cardiology, Orthopaedics, Paediatrics, Gastroenterology, Gynaecology, Urology, Minimal Access &amp; Robotic Surgery, and more.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The company had set out plans to operate a 1,200-bed network in Delhi NCR when it closed a $218 Mn seed funding round in 2025.With the inauguration of its <a href=\"/tag/gurugram+hospital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gurugram Hospital</a>, PB Health said it looks to establish a network of hospitals across India through direct ownership, strategic acquisitions, and franchise partnerships.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>“The company is actively developing additional 200-to-250-bed multispecialty hospitals across the Delhi-NCR region while rolling out a nationwide franchise model to collaborate with partner hospitals across the country,”  PB Health said in a statement.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Its recent acquisitions include Neo Hospital and health-tech platform Fitterfly.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 14, 2026 at 03:18 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 14, 2026 at 03:18 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-g-play.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"App Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"la